OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAction on knife crime needed more
OL,4,Athan ever, says Damilola Taylor's
OL,5,Abrother
OL,6,
OL,7,FBabatunde (Tunde) Taylor now chairs the
OL,8,FDamilola Taylor Trust, set up by their
OL,9,Fparents in his brother's memory. It
OL,10,Fworks to provide support for
OL,11,Fdisadvantaged children vulnerable to
OL,12,Ffalling into crime.
OL,14,FHe said issues they were currently
OL,15,Ffacing were "more diverse" than they
OL,16,Fwere when his brother died.
